{"reviews":[{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-0","r":5.0,"t":"This one\u2019s a keeper!!","x":"[[VIDEOID:87716f0b28331a9ef40385e555b9d106]] WHAT! I regret not buying this sooner! I\u2019m in nursing school and would have greatly appreciated having this when I started my nursing labs, but I did buy it just in time for my first clinical rotation!! I LOVE it! There\u2019s a velcroed pouch in the bottom front for your drivers license and other cards. I have 3 cards in there and room for a few more! I have so much room in this pouch and even with everything I have in there in the picture, I still had pl","h":23,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-1","r":4.0,"t":"Keeps your pocket organized and secured","x":"Pros: -Keeps my pens secured in my lab coat chest pocket even if I do a forward bend -2 big pockets can keep all the pens, pencils, markers, hemostats that I need -can stash a card or money in the very front pocket with the fold -clip is a nice touch if you need to hang a key on it (I don't) -comes with 2 velcro attachments for pens if you need it, they can be adjusted to fit where you want -good price, fast arrival -keeps items from falling through the seams of my pocket (old lab coats, y'know)","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-2","r":5.0,"t":"Buy this one!","x":"I am in Nursing School and this is perfect for my scrub top. I am still able to put other items in my pocket as well. I already had the supplies to put in it, I just needed something to keep things organized.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-3","r":2.0,"t":"Save your money - you won't use it","x":"I was a new nursing student and wanted to get organized and thought I just *had* to get this.  Save your money.  In reality, you will absolutely never use it and if you do - it'll be more of a nuisance than anything.  Nice concept, but definitely would waste your time.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2015"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-4","r":5.0,"t":"so this will be perfect for keeping them clean","x":"I constantly get pen ink in the pockets of my scrubs, so this will be perfect for keeping them clean. It fits nicely in my pocket and is great to keep everything organized.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great for my scrubs","x":"This pocket organizer has changed my world! Great for my scrubs. I can nicely fit 5 pens, a sharpie and alcohol swabs!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-6","r":5.0,"t":"... have a million loose items in your pockets and easy to transfer if your scrubs get dirty","x":"This is essential to not have a million loose items in your pockets and easy to transfer if your scrubs get dirty.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-7","r":3.0,"t":"Good for the bare minimum.","x":"I need to carry too much stuff... I got this to help organize and to make myself a very small IV start kit.  It barely holds a flush and 2 IV needles.  Don't even think about an extension or tegaderm kit with the tourniquet.  If you just want something that you can put a pen, pen light, and a pair of scissors with some alcohol preps, your okay, but I have faster access to those just reaching into my pocket...  On a side note, I got the Prestige Medical carry pack that is basically a fanny pack f","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2015"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-8","r":5.0,"t":"I love this as a nurse","x":"I love this as a nurse. It is super handy to have all my pens and pen lights in this. Plus it also has a Velcro pocket for my money. Great quality for the $$","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-9","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome","x":"Perfect for organizing your scrub pocket! I don't have to rummage around to find things anymore!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-10","r":5.0,"t":"No longer a hot mess","x":"I am a nursing student. I\u2019m just trying to avoid looking stupid at the hospital.  My pens, markers, calipers and medical shears used to be loose in my pocket - sometimes getting one thing out would make other things fall out onto the floor. This organizer fits perfectly into my pocket and keeps me from having to wonder what it is I\u2019m getting out of my pocket or scramble on the floor like hot mess picking up my crap. I don\u2019t get the little Velcro loops that my shears go into cause they come out o","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great work nurses","x":"Awesome little pouch to keep my pens and scissors together to throw into my pocket. The only down side is if you stuff too many pens in they won't stay in.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-12","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t waste your money","x":"Was not as pictured. Not plain white, had a breast cancer symbol with the word hope that showed through my pocket. Threw it right in the trash.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-13","r":5.0,"t":"Smart purchase","x":"This pocket organizer fits perfectly in the leg pocket of my scrubs.  Scissors fit perfectly and don't cut my scrubs.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-14","r":5.0,"t":"i love mine","x":"this fits easily in all my cargo pockets and holds my essential items. a must have so you don\u2019t lose your things at work. highly recommend. i like my scissors to be secured and hidden. not sticking out or thrashing around in a loose pocket. you could cut yourself.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-15","r":5.0,"t":"Works great","x":"Works great in my surgery provided hospital scrub top. Those pockets are huge and it\u2019s aggravating to dig for pens when needing one. This organizer really helped and it use it to hold a sharpie, two pens, a medium set of scissors and two hemostats.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-16","r":4.0,"t":"Exactly as Advertised","x":"I built my wife her own &#34;kit&#34; for Christmas so I could customize it, and this was the foundation.  I hope this helps her on her new nursing career.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-17","r":2.0,"t":"Ok","x":"Pocket is not large enough, overlapping shallow pockets do not function well for keeping the type of pens I use organized in my pocket","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2013"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-18","r":5.0,"t":"Very effective, exactly what I needed! Protects my uniform from pen marks!","x":"Several different compartments and extra velcro pocket to stash quick cash! And the color is beautiful as well! Love it!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-19","r":5.0,"t":"Pocket Organizer","x":"Bought for a friend at work...very nice & she uses it all the time!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-20","r":4.0,"t":"Only thing its white- gets dirty fast.","x":"Does it job. Only thing its white- gets dirty fast.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2015"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-21","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Perfect! Exactly as described. Very happy customer","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2014"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-22","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth the money","x":"Not wide enough compartments.  Cheaply made.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-23","r":5.0,"t":"Super functional and handy","x":"Love this organizer! I am a veterinary technician and always need multiple types of pens, markers and several instruments handy. After several markers losing their caps in my pocket staining my clothes, this solved that problem plus it is so much easier to find what I need. No more fishing around in my pocket.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B01N6UPD2H-24","r":5.0,"t":"Sufficient","x":"I dont like wearing the belts or fanny packs at work, they tend to get in my way. This fits nicely in the cargo pocket of my scrub pants and carries exactly what I need. Sometimes it will slide out of my pocket if I'm sitting down, otherwise it's just enough and not in my way","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the organizer for keeping pens, scissors, and other items neatly organized in scrub or lab coat pockets.","cites":[2,3,5,6,7,9,10,11,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers say it fits well in scrub pockets and holds essential items securely.","cites":[2,3,5,6,11,14,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers note capacity limits, saying it holds only the bare minimum or that too many pens won't stay in.","cites":[8,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers found it unnecessary or a nuisance and felt it was a waste of money.","cites":[4,13]},{"text":"One reviewer was disappointed that the product was not as pictured, showing an unexpected symbol.","cites":[13]}]},"qa":[]}